	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Launch applications using mdfind instead of Alfred's native file cache.
Workaround for when Alfred's filecache doesn't index all apps.

Keyword: a

Features:
- Lists all .app bundles found by Spotlight
- Client-side filtering by Alfred (instant after first load)
- 5-second cache for fast keystroke response
- Shows app icons
- Focuses already-running apps (no duplicate windows)</string>
